{
  "ready": "div.ProseMirror, [contenteditable='true'], [data-testid='create_conversation_button']",
  "loggedIn": "div.ProseMirror, [contenteditable='true']",
  "loggedOut": "[class*='login-panel'], [class*='login-modal'], [class*='login-container'], [class*='login']",
  "input": "div.ProseMirror, [contenteditable='true']",
  "sendButton": "[data-testid='send-button'], [class*='send-btn'], [class*='send-button']",
  "stopButton": "[data-testid='stop-button'], [class*='stop-btn'], [aria-label*='停止']",
  "assistantMessage": "[data-testid='message_text_content'], [class*='markdown']",
  "userMessage": "[data-testid='send_message'], [class*='user-message']",
  "newChat": "[data-testid='create_conversation_button'], [aria-label*='新建']",
  "fileInput": "input[type='file']",
  "blocked": "[class*='captcha'], [class*='verify']",
  "notes": "已用 2026-10-12 实测校准：输入框是 TipTap 的 div.ProseMirror（未登录时也在，所以 loggedIn 会误判为真），因此必须靠 loggedOut 判定；如果一直显示'等待登录'但其实已登录，点面板里的「我已登录」手动确认即可。"
}